=<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #333333;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 30px;
      background-color: #ffffff;
    }
    .header {
      border-bottom: 2px solid #0056b3;
      padding-bottom: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .header h2 {
      color: #0056b3;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .content {
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }
    .button-container {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 30px 0;
    }
    .btn {
      background-color: #0056b3;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      padding: 12px 25px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-radius: 5px;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .footer {
      border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
      padding-top: 15px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #777777;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h2>Service Agreement & Scope of Work</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear <strong>{{ $('On form submission').item.json["Client Name"] }}</strong>,</p>
      <p>We are pleased to share the generated <strong>Consulting Services Agreement</strong> for your upcoming project with us.</p>
      <p>Please review the details in the document linked below:</p>

      <div class="button-container">
        <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/{{ $('Create a document').item.json.id }}/edit" class="btn" target="_blank">View Agreement Document</a>
      </div>

      <p>If you have any questions or require modifications to the scope of work, please reply directly to this email.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>This is an automated notification sent by the Operations Team.<br>
      © Orvida Real Estate Consulting, LLC. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
